              "duration": 2.42,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T08:48:09.654Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "ff0f91f23d88d62f4ac6dbd2301e18327a6a38b74136c0364f07837f94582c8a"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l23-basic-dialogue-003-line-002",
            "speaker": "乙",
            "text": "ええ、日に よって 暇だったり 忙しかったりです。",
            "translationZh": "嗯，因日子而异，有时闲有时忙。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "乙：ええ、日に よって 暇だったり 忙しかったりです。",
